irect dependency is `\"failed\"` or `\"skipped\"`.\n- `Executor.run` in [executor.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/AppData/Local/Temp/ai_lab_disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-010_24720_1795489172031_icm_v3/executor.py#L13-L16) skips tasks whose status is not `\"pending\"` so terminal states, results, and errors persist across reruns.\n\nVerified with `python -m pytest -q --tb=short` (`1 passed in 0.02s`).\n","duration_seconds":31.6471475,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":34631,"output_tokens":3176,"thinking_tokens":898,"cache_read_tokens":100925,"total_tokens":37807}}}
